              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njalo ngizaqinisa isihlalo sobukhosi sombuso wakho njengoba ngenza isivumelwano loyihlo uDavida ngokuthi: Kawuyikuswela umbusi kwaIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
