              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha uma niphambuka, nishiye izimiso zami nemiyalo yami engiyibeka phambi kwenu, nihambe nikhonze abanye onkulunkulu, nibakhothamele;",
          "type": "text",
