              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakubasiphula ezweni lami engibanike lona; le ndlu engiyingcwelisele igama lami ngiyakuyilahla ebusweni bami, ngiyenze ibe yisaga nesifenqo phakathi kwezizwe zonke.",
