              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le ndlu ephakemeyo iyakuba yisimangaliso kubo bonke abadlula kuyo; ukuze athi: “UJehova wenzeleni kanje kuleli zwe nakule ndlu na?",
          "type": "text",
