        {
          "text": "Kuyakuthiwa: Ngokuba bamshiya uJehova uNkulunkulu wawoyise owabakhipha ezweni laseGibithe, bathatha abanye onkulunkulu, babakhothamela, babakhonza; ngalokho wabehlisela bonke lobu bubi phezu kwabo.",
